DESCRIPTION:Come for the creativity\, stay for the camaraderie. Our monthl
 y Open Mic is all about good vibes and real connection. Hosted by Kenny 'D
 oc' Frasier\, it’s a welcoming space for music\, poetry\, prose\, stand-
 up—or just saying what’s on your mind. This is a laid-back\, live show
  where anyone can show up and share a few minutes on the mic. Try out new 
 material\, build your confidence\, or just soak in the energy—it’s all
  fair game. And there are cookies! All ages\, all abilities are welcome.\n
 \nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/open-mic-custom-house-maritime-museum
