BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Forging the Future: Innovation & Ingenuity that Moved America - An
 nual Fundraising Dinner
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260928
DTSTAMP:20260926T145245Z
UID:4b40f1e481edb798a9de6d852c48@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a gathering celebrating the ideas\, determination
 \, and ingenuity that shaped our nation — and continue to move it forwar
 d. As America approaches its 250th anniversary\, the Shore Line Trolley Mu
 seum invites you to a special fundraising event that honors the innovators
 \, builders\, and problem-solvers who transformed transportation and conne
